separately versioned v0.2.0 research companion and portable evidence kit for accepted research source `5822cdff0fc360d9e368e10ff5f7576c3141a1b3`. The original v0.1.8 core, paper, provenance, pins/manifests, application schema and historical D0/D1 remain unchanged.\n\nThe kit contains a 21-page primary PDF, matching TeX, a 17-claim/61-provider theorem crosswalk with complete assumptions, seven preserved source-bound C10 archives, exact milestone receipts and a deterministic 27-entry ZIP. Final validation pins reviewed scientific content, checks both research source and release HEAD against340 protected canonical blobs, verifies real main/synthetic merge identities, requires code/input/export-bound review and compilation evidence, rechecks C10 exact arithmetic/generated Lean/captured proof contents, and bounds both C10 readers before their first member read. Offline receipt consistency does not authenticate GitHub or replace Lean execution.\n\nAccepted source head: `cdbe7ed5124781be495404122fac1de3315cb6ec`.\nChecked synthetic merge: `c70362b97ae7d0828a569fa15e194f9861b22b46`.\nMain merge: `d8a4ffb5b63eb9359a4c0af9134b4f9a3c529618`.\nThe checked and merged trees are identical. [Full acceptance receipt](https://github.com/HMarcusWH/PermanssonLean/pull/76#issuecomment-6236142249).\n\nValidation:\n\n- All five exact-head workflows passed, including both application OS jobs.\n- Research Lean:5248 audited declarations,810 tests,395 imports, fresh PR-only C10 generation and independent source binding, D0 goldens, original default core and source firewall PASS. Original core audit:1601 declarations, only the three permitted axioms.\n- Release CI:29 tests and44 repaired-hash negative guard controls PASS; all27 archive entries and340 protected blobs verified.\n- Fresh exact-head code review found no major issues; all seven inline findings are fixed and resolved.\n- The final TeX compiled in both desktop and independent Tectonic compilers. Independent TeX output has zero overfull/underfull boxes; all pages and ten equations were inspected. The primary PDF is separately generated by ReportLab from the same JSON and was independently inspected across all21 pages.\n- ZIP SHA256:`4db31db5b805ad2f455f27e5a2e013cd13ea257984e174f6453af8f8db5b1f6c`.\n- Primary PDF SHA256:`408daaddf3ce2c641b441cb05e2f64c739165604905f184117e50a9b9aa7225e`.\n\nScientific scope remains explicit: strict opponent-locked MA2 is OPEN; A3 is conditional dual-form robustness with supplied invariant laws and factorization, without coupling-Wasserstein/KR identification; D2 proves initialized finite-path reach-and-stay correspondence; both same-world X1 replete-region Exact-GR claims fail. X1's actual empirical occupation limits are formally identified, while unrestricted discounted-strategy verification, particular numerical margin reflection and confirmatory/grounding gates remain OPEN. The companion does not claim completion of every integration-spec obligation or empirical/substantive-PR promotion.\n\nThe kit pins the prior accepted research cut; this PR's external acceptance receipt records the final release checks without creating a self-referential acceptance or hash cycle.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-17T14:58:17Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T15:54:41Z","closed_at":"2026-10-17T15:52:17Z","merged_at":"2026-10-17T15:52:17Z","merge_commit_sha":"d8a4ffb5b63eb9359a4c0af9134b4f9a3c529618","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"HMarcusWH:codex/v020-release","ref":"codex/v020-release","repo":{"id":1379953982,"node_id":"R_kgDOUkBtPg","name":"PermanssonLean","full_name":"HMarcusWH/PermanssonLean","owner":{"login":"HMarcusWH","id":173802548,"node_id":"U_kgDOClwENA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173802548?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HMarcusWH","html_url":"https://github.com/HMarcusWH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/us